{"id":"sanctorale.09-18.german-speaking","source":"santos/santos_sep#0918","kind":"sanctoral","items":[{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"[In den Diözesen deutscher Sprache]"}]]}]},"part":"title","role":"rubric"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"h2","lines":[["18. September"],["Hl. Lambert, Bischof, Glaubensbote, Märtyrer"]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[["Lambert, in Maastricht geboren, wurde Nachfolger des Bischofs Theodard von Maastricht, seines Onkels, als dieser um 670 ermordet wurde. Als 676 sein Freund, der austrasische König Childerich II. erschlagen wurde, musste Lambert in die Verbannung gehen und lebte sieben Jahre in Stablo streng nach der Klosterregel. 681 konnte er in seine Bischofsstadt zurückkehren. Er begann, die Diözese wieder in Ordnung zu bringen und arbeitete zusammen mit dem heiligen Willibrord an der Bekehrung der Heiden. 705 wurde Lambert ermordet, während er in einer Kirche betete."]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Commune-Texte für Bischöfe:"}],[{"m":"link","t":"1","to":"common.pastors.3"},{"m":"link","t":"2","to":"common.pastors.4"}],[{"m":"rubric","t":", oder für Glaubensboten:"}],[{"m":"link","t":"1","to":"common.pastors.10"},{"m":"link","t":"2","to":"common.pastors.11"},{"m":"link","t":"3","to":"common.pastors.12"}],[{"m":"rubric","t":", oder für Märtyrer:"}],[{"m":"link","t":"1","to":"common.martyrs.1"},{"m":"link","t":"2","to":"common.martyrs.2"},{"m":"link","t":"3","to":"common.martyrs.3"},{"m":"link","t":"4","to":"common.martyrs.4"},{"m":"link","t":"5","to":"common.martyrs.5"}],[{"m":"rubric","t":"."}]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Tagesgebet"]]}]},"part":"collect"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[["Gott, von dem alles Gute kommt, aus Liebe zu dir hat der heilige Bischof und Märtyrer Lambert Besitz und Leben gering geachtet. Gib uns auf seine Fürsprache die Freiheit des Geistes, damit wir uns ohne Zögern deiner Führung überlassen. Darum bitten wir durch Jesus Christus."]]}]},"part":"collect"},{"slot":"105","text":{"la":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Præfatio"]]}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefácio"]]}],"en-US":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Preface"]]}],"es":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefacio"]]}],"it":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefazio"]]}],"fr":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Préface"]]}],"de":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Präfation"]]}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true},{"slot":"106","text":{"la":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"De sanctis martyribus"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Quóniam beáti mártyris N. pro confessióne...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... Quóniam tu magnificáris in tuórum...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Dos Santos Mártires"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"...O sangue que o Santo Mártir N. derramou...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"...Vós sois exaltado quando celebramos os santos...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"en-US":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"HOLY MARTYRS"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... For the blood of your blessed...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... For you are glorified when your Saints...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"es":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Santos Mártires"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Porque la sangre del glorioso mártir...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"...Porque tú eres ensalzado en la alabanza de tus santos...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"it":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"DEI MARTIRI"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... A imitazione del Cristo tuo Figlio...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"fr":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Des Martyrs"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Nous reconnaissons un signe éclatant de ta grâce...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... En louant tes saints martyrs,...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"de":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"MÄRTYRERN"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"...Im Martyrium des (der) heiligen N. ...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true},{"slot":"107","text":{"la":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"De sanctis pastoribus "},{"m":"link","t":"... Quia sic tríbuis Ecclésiam tuam sancti...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Dos Santos Pastores "},{"m":"link","t":"...Vós nos concedeis a alegria...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"en-US":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"HOLY PASTORS "},{"m":"link","t":"... For, as on the festival of Saint...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"es":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Santos Pastores "},{"m":"link","t":"... Porque nos concedes la alegría...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"it":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"DEI SANTI PASTORI "},{"m":"link","t":"... Tu doni alla tua Chiesa...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"fr":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Des Pasteurs "},{"m":"link","t":"... Tu donnes à ton Église de se réjouir..","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"de":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"HIRTEN DER KIRCHE "},{"m":"link","t":"... am Fest des heiligen N. deine Größe...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true}],"precedence":12.0,"prefaces":["preface.54","preface.55","preface.56"],"commons":["common.pastors.3","common.pastors.4","common.pastors.10","common.pastors.11","common.pastors.12","common